# 换行以 LF 为准，检出也用 LF。
#
# 不写这一条时，Windows 上 `core.autocrlf` 会把工作区 checkout 成 CRLF：biome 只认 LF，
# 于是同一份代码在本地 `npm run lint` 报错、在 CI（Linux）上通过。存库与检出都钉成 LF 之后，
# 两边看到的是同一份字节。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 自己读的脚本保留 CRLF：cmd.exe 与 PowerShell 对 LF 的批处理/脚本处理不稳
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.nsh text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不参与换行转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.wasm binary
*.node binary
*.woff2 binary
*.woff binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary
*.tar binary
*.7z binary
*.pdf binary
*.icns binary
